title: "agent-memory-layer"
abstract: >-
  A local-first memory and skill-governance layer for multiple coding agents:
  cross-agent session capture with original timestamps, distillation into
  cross-project knowledge, staged retrieval with budgets and explanations,
  human-readable markdown mirror, and capability-declared skill governance.
